=== ev-potluck
talks: grange, office
actions: bench, lobby

--- start
Friday coalition potluck, church hall two blocks makai of the Capitol. Someone brought squid lūʻau, someone brought Costco chicken bake, and somebody's cousin on Senate staff brought a rumor about conference chairs. Attendance is, technically, optional.
BASE BUILDING: Half the real deals of the decade get made over paper plates. Go. Bring something store-bought and humble.
TALK STORY: Go — but work the room. The staff there know which bills are actually moving, three weeks before the papers do.

* Go. Eat. Listen twice as much as you talk.
  {+1 support, +1 influence}
  You learn two referral rumors and one recipe. The week ends warmer than it started.

* Skip it. The inbox is a crime scene.
  {}
  Productive, lonely. Monday, everyone else shares an inside joke about the chicken bake.
